## What to deliver

Build the Gloamfin sprite sheet up operation by operation until the image in
`canvas.png` matches the brief and the target: an eyeless violet predator drawn in
each of its 32×32 frame cells — swimming down, up, left, and right (two frames
each), and the sonar-pulse animation. When you are satisfied, stop: the recorded
`actions.json` is your finished submission.
